  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（うみゅみゅ……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（何だったんすかね、さっきの？　せがっち委員長、いつも厳しいっていうか腐れ外道だし～？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（優しく抱きしめられたりすると、ミョ～に不安になるっす！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（まぁ、むかしから……。ほんとにあたしが嫌がることは、あんまりしないし）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（あとから思いだしてみると、あたしのためを思って厳しくしてた～みたいな感じだったりするし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（いや単純に、ストレス発散にいじめられることもあるけどっ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（なぜか嫌いになれない、っていうか放っておけないんすよね……。たまに、すごく寂しそうな顔するし）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（あのひと友達すくなそうだし、あたしが相手してあげないとっ♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（～♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（よぉし、気持ちを切り換えて『夏祭り』の準備をがんばるっす！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（これが終わったらバスケに全力投球っすよ、えいえいおうっ☆）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（ふむ。この人だかりができてる部屋に、転校生の先輩がいるって話っすけど……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（何やってるんすかね、ほんとに？　忙しいようだったら、荷物持ちを頼むのも気が引けるっすね～……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（あの御影さんちのお嬢さんも、何かしてるっぽいし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（う～むむ、あんまりあたしの手に余るようなトラブルは勘弁っすよ～？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（御影さんちのお嬢さん、二年前に何かやらかしたっぽいんすよね……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（あたしは当時、ぜんぜん何もわからない中学生だったし……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（あのころの『夏祭り』の当日は、両親と一緒に避暑地だったし）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（だから後から話を聞いただけっすけど、えらい大惨事だったみたいっすね～？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（事件がおきた年の『夏祭り』主催者は、円城寺さんのところだったみたいっすけど。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（あの大財閥ですら収拾つけられなかった、っていうだけで事態の深刻さがわかるっす）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（和菓子屋の御影、といえば全国どころか全世界に支店をもつ大御所っすけど。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（そのぐらいの規模の富豪なら、このへんじゃ珍しくないっす）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（だからお金の問題じゃない、円城寺財閥でも解決できなかったっていうのは『そういうこと』っすよね。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（何か、異様なことが起きたっぽい？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（あたしが聞いたかぎりでは、和菓子屋の御影が屋台をだして……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（そこで販売された人形焼きが原因で、大パニックがおきた～って感じっすけど）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（人形焼きなんかで、どうして？　集団食中毒とかがあったんすかね、ふつうに考えると？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（そういえばこの町の和菓子屋の御影の本店は、それっきりお休みしてるし～？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（でも『それだけ』のことで、こんな何年も語り継がれて……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（ううん、触れてはならない禁忌みたいに……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（みんな、そのことについて口を閉ざしたりしないっすよね）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（あたしも、好奇心で二年前の出来事について聞いてみたことあるっすけど。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（お父さまやお母さまも、何も教えてくれないし）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（ただ和菓子屋の御影がでてきたら気をつけろって、さんざん忠告されたっす）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（ど～しよう、二年前の再現みたいなことになったら。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（『夏祭り』が中止になっちゃうかもしれないっす、がんばって準備してるのに～？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（うちの両親、あんまりあたしがバスケやってることに良い顔しないし……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（『夏祭り』を大失敗でもさせたら、それを理由にバスケ部を辞めさせられちゃうかも？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（罰だ、とか言われて……。桃智家のことに集中しろって、強制的に退部させられかねないっすよ～？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（バスケの大会でどれだけ勝ち進んでも、お父さまやお母さまにとっては無価値だろうし……？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "（でも嫌っす、あたしはバスケがしたいっす！　もっともっと、こまっち先輩たちと一緒に……！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
