    }
  },
  {
    "command": "remove_still_image"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「ぎょっ？　あ、あんた……えっ？　何これ、どういう状況っすか!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「な、何か知らない女のひとが室内なのに水着でビニールプールに入って……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「なぜか目を瞑ったまま、いろんなお皿にのったお菓子とかを食べてるっす！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「あ、ありのままに見たことを『そのまんま』言ったっすけど！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「自分で言ってて意味がわからないっす、何これっ？　あんた、何してるんすか～!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「あっ、転校生の先輩もいるっす！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「その変なひとに、お菓子とかを食べさせてあげてるんすか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「どうして？　えっと、いろいろ説明してほしいっす！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「ふむ、ふむ。このひとが、和菓子屋の御影のご令嬢……御影かすみ先輩？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「そういえば昔ちらっとお会いしたことがあるような、ないような？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「えっと……。失礼っすけど、かすみ先輩が二年前の事件をおこした犯人とかだったりするんすか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「たしか和菓子屋の御影の娘さんは、料理の天才だって聞いたことがあるっす！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あすか",
    "text": "「そのひとが、二年前の事件の主犯だったって……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 36,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -24,
      "y": 502
    }
  },
  {
